  "description": "Automatic opening vent to eastern roofslope; replacement rooflight/access hatch to eastern roofslope (Part retrospective)",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the application form and the details submitted in Condition 2 of this permission.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&nbsp;Design &amp; Access Statement Rev A, Fire Safety Strategy Report – Rev 2.0, Heritage Statement Rev A, 24-004-P-02A, 24-004-P-04A, 24-004-P-05C, 24-004-P-11B, 24-004-P-14B, 24-004-P-15C, 24-004-P-21B, 24-004-P-24D, 24-004-P-25D, 24-004-P-31D.",
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding the approved plans, the automatic opening vent will be flush with the roofline when closed and retained as such thereafter.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed Automatic Opening Vent hereby approved shall be used solely for smoke ventilation purposes and not for the discharge of fumes or odours.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall be implemented in accordance with the fire safety details set out in the submitted Fire Safety Strategy Report (Ref. Fire Safety Strategy Report – Rev 2.0) and shall be maintained hereafter.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
